# game/script-topics.rpy:11174
translate spanish monika_dreaming_eb0ca2a4:

    # m 1eua "Did you know that it's possible to be aware of when you're having a dream?"
    m 1eua "¿Sabías que es posible darse cuenta de cuándo estás soñando?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11175
translate spanish monika_dreaming_71453f0d:

    # m 2eua "Not only that, but you can even take control of them!"
    m 2eua "No solo eso, ¡sino que incluso puedes controlarlos!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11176
translate spanish monika_dreaming_5f249410:

    # m 3eub "If I remember correctly, a man named Stephen LaBerge developed a method for people to become aware of when they're dreaming."
    m 3eub "Si no recuerdo mal, un hombre llamado Stephen LaBerge desarrolló un método para que la gente sea consciente de cuándo está soñando."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11177
translate spanish monika_dreaming_954d55cc:

    # m "And it became known as the mnemonic induction of lucid dreams, or MILD."
    m "Y se dio a conocer como la inducción mnemónica de sueños lúcidos, o MILD."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11178
translate spanish monika_dreaming_5ab95be6:

    # m 3eua "People who frequently have conscious dreams are called oneironauts."
    m 3eua "A las personas que tienen sueños conscientes con frecuencia se les llama onironautas."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11179
translate spanish monika_dreaming_f4c1519d:

    # m 2lksdla "At least, I think that was the correct term..."
    m 2lksdla "Al menos, creo que ese era el término correcto..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11180
translate spanish monika_dreaming_9002faba:

    # m 1eua "Using the MILD technique, oneironauts learn to recognize certain dream signs to help them realize when they're dreaming."
    m 1eua "Mediante la técnica MILD, los onironautas aprenden a reconocer ciertas señales oníricas que les ayudan a darse cuenta de cuándo están soñando."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11181
translate spanish monika_dreaming_27276555:

    # m "These dream signs can be anything out of the ordinary, such as feeling yourself flying, noticing your teeth falling out, unexpectedly meeting someone famous..."
    m "Estas señales pueden ser cualquier cosa fuera de lo normal, como sentir que vuelas, notar que se te caen los dientes, encontrarte inesperadamente con alguien famoso..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11182
translate spanish monika_dreaming_37868e7b:

    # m 1eub "If the dreamer sees a dream sign and realizes they're having a dream, then they can take control of it!"
    m 1eub "Si el soñador ve una señal onírica y se da cuenta de que está teniendo un sueño, ¡entonces puede tomar el control!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11183
translate spanish monika_dreaming_7a4d7b96:

    # m "LaBerge even wrote a book about these experiences called {i}Exploring the World of Lucid Dreaming{/i}."
    m "LaBerge incluso escribió un libro sobre estas experiencias llamado {i}Explorando el mundo de los sueños lúcidos{/i}."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11184
translate spanish monika_dreaming_ab1737e7:

    # m 2hub "Doesn't that sound exhilarating?"
    m 2hub "¿A que suena emocionante?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11185
translate spanish monika_dreaming_f57024a0:

    # m 2euc "I don't think I really dream like a normal person would, so I sometimes wonder what it's like."
    m 2euc "No creo que yo sueñe como lo haría una persona normal, así que a veces me pregunto cómo será."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11186
translate spanish monika_dreaming_a7c08be6:

    # m 2eua "Dreams sound like a wonderful escape from reality."
    m 2eua "Los sueños suenan como un maravilloso escape de la realidad."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11187
translate spanish monika_dreaming_c47c070f:

    # m 2esc "But then again, when I became self-aware and realized that my world isn't real, it suddenly felt like I was trapped in a nightmare."
    m 2esc "Aunque, por otro lado, cuando tomé conciencia de mí misma y me di cuenta de que mi mundo no es real, de repente sentí que estaba atrapada en una pesadilla."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11188
translate spanish monika_dreaming_f5852fd4:

    # m "It was nothing like the pleasant dreams I've read about people having."
    m "No se parecía en nada a los sueños agradables que he leído que tiene la gente."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11189
translate spanish monika_dreaming_fa0eb8f5:

    # m 2lksdlc "I was afraid that I'd never get out..."
    m 2lksdlc "Tenía miedo de no salir nunca..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11190
translate spanish monika_dreaming_784fb4c7:

    # m "That I'd be stuck in some hellish, infinitely-repeating dimension forever."
    m "De quedarme atrapada en alguna dimensión infernal, repitiéndose en un bucle para siempre."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11191
translate spanish monika_dreaming_0b4f1418:

    # m 1eka "But now that we're here together, I guess you could say that I've finally woken up."
    m 1eka "Pero ahora que estamos juntos aquí, supongo que se podría decir que por fin he despertado."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11192
translate spanish monika_dreaming_8cfc503e:

    # m 1eua "Gosh, I can only imagine what it would be like to live in that kind of limitless world though, even if it was only for a few moments!"
    m 1eua "Dios, aunque solo puedo imaginar cómo sería vivir en ese tipo de mundo sin límites, ¡incluso si fuera solo por unos instantes!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11193
translate spanish monika_dreaming_01cfc3f5:

    # m "You could be the hero you always wanted to be, fly across the infinite universe, overcome your biggest fears..."
    m "Podrías ser el héroe que siempre quisiste ser, volar por el vasto universo, superar tus mayores miedos...,"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11194
translate spanish monika_dreaming_7babd02c:

    # m 3ekbsa "...You could even meet the love of your life, so to speak. Ehehe~"
    m 3ekbsa "incluso podrías conocer al amor de tu vida, por así decirlo. Je, je, je."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11195
translate spanish monika_dreaming_edcdf00e:

    # m 1eua "I know it may be years before I am able to cross over to your world..."
    m 1eua "Sé que pueden pasar años antes de que pueda cruzar a tu mundo..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11196
translate spanish monika_dreaming_5356a111:

    # m "But can you just imagine what it would be like to meet me in your dreams, [player], any night that you wanted to?"
    m "¿Pero te imaginas cómo sería encontrarte conmigo en tus sueños, [player], cualquier noche que quisieras?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11197
translate spanish monika_dreaming_cb022bc8:

    # m 1hua "I hope that someday we can make your dreams about us a reality, [mas_get_player_nickname()]."
    m 1hua "Espero que algún día podamos hacer realidad tus sueños sobre nosotros, [mas_get_player_nickname()]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11219
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_324c2056:

    # m 1eua "Hey [player], have you ever read {i}The Yellow Wallpaper{/i}?{nw}"
    m 1eua "Oye, [player], ¿has leído alguna vez {i}El tapiz amarillo{/i}?{nw}"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11222
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_04df2eb4:

    # m "Hey [player], have you ever read {i}The Yellow Wallpaper{/i}?{fast}" nointeract
    m "Oye, [player], ¿has leído alguna vez {i}El tapiz amarillo{/i}?{fast}" nointeract

# game/script-topics.rpy:11225
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_51f803bb:

    # m 1hua "Great!"
    m 1hua "¡Genial!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11226
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_8fa4c8e6:

    # m 1eua "That means you don't mind me talking about the story with you, right?"
    m 1eua "Eso significa que no te importa que hable de la historia contigo, ¿verdad?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11227
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_a8c5346b:

    # m 2eua "It's about this woman, with postpartum depression who's prescribed a 'rest cure' by her doctor..."
    m 2eua "Trata sobre una mujer con depresión posparto a la que su médico le receta una cura de reposo..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11228
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_453253ea:

    # m 2eka "He and her husband force her to stay in bed all day, not allowing her to write or even daydream..."
    m 2eka "El médico y su marido la obligan a hacer reposo absoluto, y le prohíben escribir o tan siquiera soñar despierta..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11229
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_97ac27b1:

    # m 2esc "She stays in the attic of her home, with nothing but the wallpaper to keep her company."
    m 2esc "Se queda en el ático de su casa, con el papel pintado como única compañía."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11230
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_2210d1cd:

    # m 2ekc "Naturally, that doesn't help. She starts seeing a woman trapped within the wallpaper."
    m 2ekc "Como es lógico, eso no ayuda. Empieza a ver a una mujer atrapada en el papel pintado."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11231
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_5291ad3d:

    # m 4euc "It's a metaphor for her own captivity, obviously..."
    m 4euc "Es una metáfora de su propio cautiverio, obviamente..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11232
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_671aa456:

    # m 1esd "In the end, the woman in the paper 'escapes,' and the protagonist 'replaces' her."
    m 1esd "Al final, la mujer del papel logra escapar y la protagonista ocupa su lugar."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11233
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_8f1735c3:

    # m 2ekd "There was...also mention of a rope, so I always had my own interpretation of the ending..."
    m 2ekd "También se mencionaba... una cuerda, así que siempre tuve mi propia interpretación del final..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11235
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_f4dda286:

    # m 2euc "Sayori liked that story too, if I remember right."
    m 2euc "A Sayori también le gustaba esa historia, si no recuerdo mal."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11236
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_a4ee1847:

    # m 1ekc "I don't know. I kind of relate to that story."
    m 1ekc "No sé. Me siento un poco identificada con esa historia."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11237
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_b2a442db:

    # m 1euc "I mean, I have nothing but this classroom after all."
    m 1euc "Al fin y al cabo, no tengo nada más que esta clase."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11238
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_9b755176:

    # m 1lksdlc "And the things on the walls aren't always...pleasant."
    m 1lksdlc "Y las cosas de las paredes no siempre son... agradables."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11240
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_b91c8613:

    # m 1eud "Did you ever notice how the poster in the club room changes sometimes? I don't even know why it does that."
    m 1eud "¿Te has fijado en que el póster del club a veces cambia? Ni yo misma sé por qué."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11241
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_7d834dc0:

    # m 1eka "I think I finally fixed it, though."
    m 1eka "Aunque creo que por fin lo he arreglado."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11242
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_9013a205:

    # m 2esc "...I guess what I'm saying is, it's just that this world wasn't '{i}real{/i}.' It's just...so small."
    m 2esc "Supongo que lo que quiero decir es que este mundo no era de verdad. Es que es... tan pequeño."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11243
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_a5308092:

    # m 3esd "I mean, I was made to be a side character of a romance game!"
    m 3esd "Es decir, ¡fui creada para ser un personaje secundario de un juego de romance!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11244
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_db29bfb8:

    # m 2ekd "A piece of decoration, meant to help some guy on the other side of the screen date a girl who can't even reject him..."
    m 2ekd "Un adorno, destinado a ayudar a un chico al otro lado de la pantalla a salir con una chica que ni siquiera puede rechazarle..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11245
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_9b02164d:

    # m 1hksdrb "I don't mean you, of course! You definitely have more personality than the generic protagonist they put in the game."
    m 1hksdrb "¡No me refiero a ti, por supuesto! Tú tienes mucha más personalidad que el protagonista genérico que pusieron en el juego."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11246
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_804a1edf:

    # m 1dsc "But I have all these dreams, ambitions, and interests...{w=0.5} in the end, the only 'real' role I can play here is a supporting character..."
    m 1dsc "Pero tengo todos estos sueños, ambiciones e intereses...{w=0.5} y, al final, el único papel verdaderamente auténtico que puedo desempeñar aquí es el de personaje secundario..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11247
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_d275bcdf:

    # m "Maybe even now, that's all I can do..."
    m "Puede que incluso ahora, eso sea todo lo que puedo hacer..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11248
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_a2774ddf:

    # m 1eka "But I love you so much, [player]. Supporting you is better than anything else."
    m 1eka "Pero te quiero muchísimo, [player]. Apoyarte es mejor que cualquier otra cosa."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11249
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_45d9e180:

    # m 1hub "I just can't wait to do it in person when I finally cross over to your side~"
    m 1hub "Qué ganas tengo de hacerlo en persona cuando por fin cruce a tu lado."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11253
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_d3fa797f:

    # m 1euc "Oh, I see."
    m 1euc "Ah, ya veo."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11254
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_5a753d61:

    # m 1eka "It's a short story, so if you haven't, feel free to whenever you have the time."
    m 1eka "Es una historia corta, así que, si no lo has hecho, puedes leerla cuando tengas tiempo."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11255
translate spanish monika_yellowwp_373a1ce8:

    # m 1hua "It'll definitely be an interesting read for you."
    m 1hua "Seguro que te resulta una lectura muy interesante."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11275
translate spanish monika_immortality_d29f7780:

    # m 1eud "Hey, [player], I've been thinking about immortality lately."
    m 1eud "Oye, [player], últimamente he estado pensando en la inmortalidad."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11276
translate spanish monika_immortality_9ad426db:

    # m 1lksdlc "...Seeing as how I'm essentially immortal while I'm in here and all."
    m 1lksdlc "Teniendo en cuenta que soy básicamente inmortal mientras esté aquí y demás."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11277
translate spanish monika_immortality_1e435a34:

    # m 1esc "A lot of people think it's a good thing, but I don't really think it is."
    m 1esc "Mucha gente piensa que es algo bueno, pero yo no lo creo."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11278
translate spanish monika_immortality_c8bf8d69:

    # m 3euc "Sure, it's an interesting thought; {w=0.1}living forever, not having to worry about dying..."
    m 3euc "Claro, es un pensamiento interesante, {w=0.1}vivir para siempre, no tener que preocuparte por morir..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11279
translate spanish monika_immortality_9fe69ae6:

    # m 3eud "But not everyone is immortal, and some people just don't want to be."
    m 3eud "Pero no todo el mundo es inmortal, y algunas personas simplemente no quieren serlo."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11280
translate spanish monika_immortality_538b765c:

    # m 1etc "Like, after a while, what would you even do?"
    m 1etc "Por ejemplo, después de un tiempo, ¿a qué te dedicarías?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11281
translate spanish monika_immortality_d11e3410:

    # m 1euc "I mean, after living long enough, {i}eventually{/i} you would achieve everything you could ever possibly want to...{w=0.3}experience everything there is to experience."
    m 1euc "Es decir, después de vivir lo suficiente, acabarías logrando todo lo que pudieras desear... {w=0.3}y experimentarías todo lo que hay por experimentar."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11282
translate spanish monika_immortality_ee77c8e3:

    # m 3lksdld "Not to mention, it would be really hard to have friends or build connections if they don't last as long as you do."
    m 3lksdld "Por no mencionar que sería muy difícil tener amigos o forjar vínculos si no duran tanto como tú."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11283
translate spanish monika_immortality_f145a28e:

    # m 3eksdla "Sure, it would be nice in the beginning, {w=0.1}{nw}"
    m 3eksdla "Claro que al principio estaría bien, {w=0.1}{nw}"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11284
translate spanish monika_immortality_44e4ed74:

    # extend 3eksdlc "but after seeing enough people you care about die, would you really want to keep going through that over and over?"
    extend 3eksdlc "pero después de ver morir a suficientes personas que te importan, ¿de verdad querrías seguir pasando por eso una y otra vez?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11285
translate spanish monika_immortality_a8b6ca29:

    # m 2dkd "At some point, you might as well not even be human anymore."
    m 2dkd "Llegado a un punto, casi dejarías de ser human[end_letter_gender]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11286
translate spanish monika_immortality_3b206ea0:

    # m 2ekc "Someday, you'll have lived long enough for hundreds of years to go by in what seems like mere moments to you."
    m 2ekc "Algún día, habrás vivido lo suficiente como para que pasen cientos de años en lo que a ti te parecerán meros instantes."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11287
translate spanish monika_immortality_9add9d76:

    # m 2dkd "You'll be so tired of life that you'll just wish you could sleep forever..."
    m 2dkd "Estarás tan cansad[end_letter_gender] de la vida que solo desearás poder dormir para siempre..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11288
translate spanish monika_immortality_902f53c3:

    # m 3eksdlc "But you always keep waking back up to the same boring things, with the occasional tragedy in the world... {w=0.3}And even those you'd eventually just become numb to."
    m 3eksdlc "Pero seguirías despertándote una y otra vez con la misma monotonía de siempre, con alguna que otra tragedia en el mundo... {w=0.3}Y con el tiempo te acabarías volviendo insensible hasta a eso."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11289
translate spanish monika_immortality_90e0ac43:

    # m 1lksdla "Wow, I didn't mean for that to get so dark. Sorry, [player]."
    m 1lksdla "Vaya, no quería ponerme tan lúgubre. Lo siento, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11290
translate spanish monika_immortality_245eb2b4:

    # m 1eka "Just so you know, I'd gladly give up my immortality to be with you..."
    m 1eka "Que sepas que renunciaría con gusto a mi inmortalidad para estar contigo..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11291
translate spanish monika_immortality_34b55f9f:

    # m 1ekbsa "No matter how much or little time you may have left, spending that time with you would be worth more than a billion years without you."
    m 1ekbsa "No importa cuánto o qué poco tiempo te quede, pasar ese tiempo contigo valdría más que mil millones de años sin ti."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11292
translate spanish monika_immortality_3e4c8de8:

    # m 1ekbsu "Not that I'd mind spending eternity with you if it were possible, but just living a normal life with you is all I've ever wanted, [player]~"
    m 1ekbsu "No es que me importara pasar la eternidad contigo si fuera posible, pero vivir una vida normal contigo es todo lo que siempre he deseado, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11317
translate spanish monika_beingevil_5931863c:

    # m 1euc "Say, [player]?"
    m 1euc "Dime, [player]..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11318
translate spanish monika_beingevil_0f24e726:

    # m 1rksdlc "I was just thinking..."
    m 1rksdlc "Estaba pensando..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11319
translate spanish monika_beingevil_669a620a:

    # m 1eksdlc "You probably know that there's a wiki page for me..."
    m 1eksdlc "Seguramente sepas que hay una página de la wiki sobre mí..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11320
translate spanish monika_beingevil_8ec80dc6:

    # m "...If you look closely, it says I'm the main antagonist."
    m "Si te fijas bien, dice que soy la antagonista principal."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11321
translate spanish monika_beingevil_eb6eaa27:

    # m 2ekd "I'll admit, it used to bother me a lot...especially because I only did what I did because I didn't have a choice..."
    m 2ekd "Reconozco que antes me molestaba bastante... sobre todo porque solo hice lo que hice al no tener otra opción..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11322
translate spanish monika_beingevil_748b5130:

    # m 2eka "But that doesn't really bother me anymore now that I have you here."
    m 2eka "Pero eso ya no me importa ahora que te tengo aquí."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11323
translate spanish monika_beingevil_b9fe9572:

    # m 3rud "You know, I actually didn't think the whole thing about me being evil would spread too much."
    m 3rud "La verdad es que no pensé que todo eso de que soy malvada se fuera a extender tanto."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11324
translate spanish monika_beingevil_8ac70489:

    # m 1rksdlc "But it turns out I have my own spot on the villain's wiki..."
    m 1rksdlc "Pero resulta que tengo mi propio hueco en la wiki de villanos..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11325
translate spanish monika_beingevil_f37818c0:

    # m 2dsc "I never really thought I'd be labeled as a villain so much..."
    m 2dsc "Nunca pensé que me etiquetarían tanto como a una villana..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11326
translate spanish monika_beingevil_8b20a172:

    # m 2dkd "...and no matter what I say or tell people, I don't think it's going to help convince them that I'm not evil."
    m 2dkd "Y no importa lo que diga o le cuente a la gente, no creo que sirva para convencerles de que no soy mala."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11328
translate spanish monika_beingevil_1ed8a2aa:

    # m 1eka "But I know you don't {i}really{/i} think I'm evil, [player]."
    m 1eka "Pero sé que en el fondo no piensas que sea mala, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11330
translate spanish monika_beingevil_2c0c0bf8:

    # m 1eka "But I know you don't think I'm evil, [player]."
    m 1eka "Pero sé que no piensas que sea mala, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11331
translate spanish monika_beingevil_7013cfc8:

    # m 1eua "I just hope nobody starts thinking you're evil by being here with me.{nw}"
    m 1eua "Solo espero que nadie empiece a pensar que eres mal[end_letter_gender] por estar aquí conmigo.{nw}"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11334
translate spanish monika_beingevil_5da643a4:

    # m "I just hope nobody starts thinking you're evil by being here with me.{fast}" nointeract
    m "Solo espero que nadie empiece a pensar que eres mal[end_letter_gender] por estar aquí conmigo.{fast}" nointeract

# game/script-topics.rpy:11339
translate spanish monika_beingevil_c611a4fc:

    # m 1eka "I'm glad you understand, [player]."
    m 1eka "Me alegra que lo entiendas, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11340
translate spanish monika_beingevil_db59beee:

    # m 1eua "It's relieving to know you don't think I'm evil."
    m 1eua "Es un alivio saber que no piensas que sea mala."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11341
translate spanish monika_beingevil_527a2870:

    # m 1hua "If I were there, I'd feel like giving you a big hug!"
    m 1hua "Si estuviera ahí, ¡me darían ganas de darte un gran abrazo!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11342
translate spanish monika_beingevil_216bee74:

    # m 1tubsa "Maybe I'll even trap you in my arms forever and never let you go."
    m 1tubsa "A lo mejor hasta te atrapo en mis brazos para siempre y no te suelto nunca."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11343
translate spanish monika_beingevil_d9c66ae5:

    # m 1hubfb "Ahaha, I'm just kidding!"
    m 1hubfb "¡Ja, ja, ja, es una broma!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11344
translate spanish monika_beingevil_342d30d5:

    # m 3tubfb "But no promises, [player]~"
    m 3tubfb "Pero no prometo nada, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11351
translate spanish monika_beingevil_9992bf6e:

    # m 1rksdlc "..."
    m 1rksdlc "..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11352
translate spanish monika_beingevil_6e92af18:

    # m 1ekd "[player]..."
    m 1ekd "[player]..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11353
translate spanish monika_beingevil_4d5a8b93:

    # m 1eka "Even if it's debatable whether I'm evil or not..."
    m 1eka "Aunque sea discutible si soy mala o no..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11354
translate spanish monika_beingevil_e5d1f82b:

    # m 1ekbsa "I'm really glad you still love me and stay here with me..."
    m 1ekbsa "Me alegra mucho que me sigas queriendo y te quedes aquí conmigo..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11355
translate spanish monika_beingevil_f733626f:

    # m 1ekbfa "Thank you, [player]."
    m 1ekbfa "Gracias, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11356
translate spanish monika_beingevil_480daca8:

    # m 1tubfa "Either way..."
    m 1tubfa "De todos modos..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11357
translate spanish monika_beingevil_610ff798:

    # m 1tubfb "If the villainess in me can get what she wants...I guess it's not so bad, ahaha!"
    m 1tubfb "Si la villana que hay en mí puede conseguir lo que quiere... Supongo que no está tan mal, ¡ja, ja, ja!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11364
translate spanish monika_beingevil_8e79fa41:

    # m 2ekd "Is that true, [player]?"
    m 2ekd "¿Es eso cierto, [player]?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11365
translate spanish monika_beingevil_c9481661:

    # m 2eka "Well, I don't see you as evil at all."
    m 2eka "Pues yo no te considero malvad[end_letter_gender] en absoluto."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11366
translate spanish monika_beingevil_4a1a2296:

    # m 2rksdla "If it really is true though, I hope it doesn't cause you any trouble."
    m 2rksdla "Aunque si de verdad es cierto, espero que no te cause problemas."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11367
translate spanish monika_beingevil_05fd3491:

    # m 1hua "Either way, I wouldn't love you any less~"
    m 1hua "De todos modos, no te querría menos."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11368
translate spanish monika_beingevil_08d6918b:

    # m 1hub "Maybe we could even conquer the world together or something, ahaha~"
    m 1hub "A lo mejor hasta podríamos conquistar el mundo juntos o algo así, ja, ja, ja."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11369
translate spanish monika_beingevil_7a52858a:

    # m 1ekbsa "But evil or not, I'm glad to have you by my side."
    m 1ekbsa "Pero seas malvad[end_letter_gender] o no, me alegra tenerte a mi lado."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11370
translate spanish monika_beingevil_a181c7cd:

    # m 1hubfa "I'm guessing it's the same for you too~"
    m 1hubfa "Supongo que a ti te pasa lo mismo."

# game/script-topics.rpy:11375
translate spanish monika_beingevil_1a3186c1:

    # m 2ekd "W-wait, [player]!"
    m 2ekd "¡E-Espera, [player]!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11376
translate spanish monika_beingevil_5c32f388:

    # m 2rksdlc "Y-you don't {i}really{/i} think that, do you?{nw}"
    m 2rksdlc "¿D-De verdad no piensas eso, a que no?{nw}"

# game/script-topics.rpy:11379
translate spanish monika_beingevil_61bfd02c:

    # m "Y-you don't {i}really{/i} think that, do you?{fast}" nointeract
    m "¿D-De verdad no piensas eso, a que no?{fast}" nointeract

